From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:00:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] ci: add root pre-commit hooks, PR title check, release
 preview, dependabot

- .pre-commit-config.yaml runs each package's existing linters with explicit config paths, scoped to the package folder (codespell for all five packages); frontend lint-staged checks and the post-merge npm ci hook become pre-commit hooks; pre-commit.ci settings.
- pr-checks.yml: conventional PR titles (action-semantic-pull-request, optional package scope) and an informational release-please dry run in the job summary.
- .github/dependabot.yml replaces the per-repo copies; adds grouped Docker base image updates (no major or python minor updates) and groups the submodule updates.
- Root pull request template.
